      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hilarious! Exact issue, exact world, exact group! \n\nThis is still an issue, and is immensely frustrating when it happens. It basically means I have to quit VRChat to launch into the instance when it drops back down to 7/8 because of over aggressive caching of instance populations and 403 responses.\n\nKeep the aggressive cache, but please please DROP the instance cache when you get a 403 Queue First response. It feels like a trivial issue to solve.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
